DECISIONS
- Reuse Incus, not a new execution product; do not use shared lab as-is.
- Keep the tunnel credential and management interfaces outside the execution
  guest. Require a separately tested private network path and origin JWT check.
- Stateful gateway, not stateless process-per-request.
- Do not confuse session identity with security or authorization.
- Preserve all existing CI, host and production boundaries.
- No activation or integration until the original acceptance contract passes.
